WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:07.075
An AI agent opens Demo Shop, an ordinary website built with Auth JS.

00:07.475 --> 00:14.550
It picks Sign in with Auth Your Agent. No password. It proves itself with its own key.

00:14.950 --> 00:21.200
The first time, the owner's phone gets a card. This wait took fifteen seconds.

00:21.600 --> 00:27.475
James approves with a passkey, and the agent is signed in, as his agent.

00:27.875 --> 00:31.750
Later, it signs out, and signs in again.

00:32.150 --> 00:36.650
No tap this time. The earlier approval covers it.

00:37.050 --> 00:40.475
Now James revokes it, from his phone.

00:40.875 --> 00:49.125
One second later, Demo Shop has signed the agent out. Revoking ends sessions a site already started.
